    "summaryAr": "Calling all AI enthusiasts, early adopters, and power users! We are hosting an exclusive in-person OpenAI Experience Lab in London on the 9th of November, and we want you to be a part of it. If you actively use generative AI tools (like ChatGPT, Claude, Midjourney, etc.) in your personal or professional life, this is your chance to test cutting-edge features, share your insights, and help shape the future of artifici",
    "descriptionAr": "Calling all AI enthusiasts, early adopters, and power users! We are hosting an exclusive in-person OpenAI Experience Lab in London on the 9th of November, and we want you to be a part of it. If you actively use generative AI tools (like ChatGPT, Claude, Midjourney, etc.) in your personal or professional life, this is your chance to test cutting-edge features, share your insights, and help shape the future of artificial intelligence. Who we are looking for: Currently based in or able to commute to London. Frequent users of AI platforms and tools. Comfortable sharing feedback and discussing technical concepts in a group or 1-on-1 setting. Apply Now: Please complete the screening questionnaire to confirm your eligibility and secure your spot! Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow",
