    "summaryAr": "Our Vision: Define and dominate data-driven e-commerce design with the world's best strategists, designers, copywriters, data analysts, and developers. The last 4 years we created a new niche, that never existed: aesthetic design combined with data driven strategies. This way we outperform any other agency in the space. We rethink every best practise. We work as an agile, intentional small team with the best of the b",
    "descriptionAr": "Our Vision: Define and dominate data-driven e-commerce design with the world's best strategists, designers, copywriters, data analysts, and developers. The last 4 years we created a new niche, that never existed: aesthetic design combined with data driven strategies. This way we outperform any other agency in the space. We rethink every best practise. We work as an agile, intentional small team with the best of the best in Strategy, Data Analysis, Design and Development. Our 4 core values are: OWNERSHIP, HUNGER, EXCELLENCE, INTEGRITY. As a boutique agency, we only work with a maximum of 13 active clients. Your Responsibilities You’ll plan and manage workflows within our innovative data-driven design process. You’ll also coordinate team tasks and help bring new ideas to life. You’ll lead challenging projects for your favorite brands from Germany and the U.S. We work at a fast pace! That means being able to juggle 20 things at once is part of your daily routine. Your Profile You have extensive experience with agency projects. You have an excellent understanding of the fundamentals of e-commerce. You’re an absolute pro with Shopify. You’re a quick learner, and for you, learning and being among the best are top priorities. You’re fluent in English and German (!) The most important thing is that you bring passion and drive to bring a startup forward - for us, this isn’t just a cliché, but the top criteria for working together and being part of our team! Your Benefits Young, highly motivated team with zero ego Speed over politics: If you have an idea, run with it Earn what you’re worth: We offer good base salary + uncapped profit share. Your client results define your income As part of your team, you'll work with the top designers and developers in the German e-commerce industry Clients who work with us as partners, and brands you already love. We never stand still: every day, we learn something new and find new ways to improve things. Interview Process Assessment Culture Fit & Skill Interview with the CEO/Founder Trial Day, working hands on one day with our team Final Interview and Offer Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow",
