    "summaryAr": "ABOUT THE OPPORTUNITY LILT is building speech and language datasets for AI in five languages: Balochi, Guarani, Luxembourgish, Turkmen and Uyghur. We are looking for Community Leads who are active in these language communities to help connect speakers with paid recording and transcription work. A Community Lead is someone the community already knows and trusts. You might run a cultural society or academy, teach the l",
    "descriptionAr": "ABOUT THE OPPORTUNITY LILT is building speech and language datasets for AI in five languages: Balochi, Guarani, Luxembourgish, Turkmen and Uyghur. We are looking for Community Leads who are active in these language communities to help connect speakers with paid recording and transcription work. A Community Lead is someone the community already knows and trusts. You might run a cultural society or academy, teach the language, edit a publication, host a radio show, or manage an online group. WHAT YOU'LL DO - Share LILT opportunities with speakers in your community - Refer speakers through the Community Lead referral form - Be our point of contact for questions from your community - Take on paid recording or transcription work yourself, if you want to (optional) HOW YOU EARN - A referral bonus for each speaker you refer who completes approved work - A growth bonus once 10 of your referrals are active - Full payment details are in the Community Lead agreement you receive once approved WHO WE'RE LOOKING FOR - Fluent speaker of Balochi, Guarani, Luxembourgish, Turkmen or Uyghur - A recognized role in your language community, such as society or academy head, teacher, editor, radio host or group admin - Good working English to communicate with our team - Comfortable sharing posts and answering questions from people in your community HOW IT WORKS Community Lead is by invitation. After you apply: 1 - We review your application 2 - You have a short call with our Talent team, including a check of your role or organization 3 - You sign the Community Lead agreement 4 - You start referring speakers through the Community Lead form WHAT TO CONSIDER BEFORE APPLYING - This is an independent contractor role paid on results. Payments depend on approved work by the speakers you refer. There are no benefits and earnings are not guaranteed. - Please tell us about your role. If you work for a government or public institution, follow your employer's rules on outside paid work. - Everyone you refer must be 18 or older. - Participation is voluntary. We do not publish a list of Community Leads. - Geographic restrictions may apply. We cannot engage contractors in regions subject to international embargo or sanctions. As a contractor, you are responsible for your own tax obligations. AI is changing how the world communicates — and LILT is leading that transformation. LILT's mission is to make the world's information available to everyone, no matter the language they speak. Join our global community who thrive on innovation and excellence. Our collective knowledge, uniqueness, and skills deliver multilingual AI and human-verified services to Enterprises, Governments, and AI Developers around the world. Earn money. Have fun. Advance human knowledge. Work on diverse projects from anywhere, any time you want. Get paid quickly and fairly, and build your professional network in a supportive community—all through a streamlined application process tailored to your expertise. Information collected and processed as part of your application process, including any job applications you choose to submit, is subject to LILT's Privacy Policy at https://lilt.com/legal/privacy . At LILT, we are committed to a fair, inclusive, and transparent hiring process. As part of our recruitment efforts, we may use artificial intelligence (AI) and automated tools to assist in the evaluation of applications, including résumé screening, assessment scoring, and interview analysis. These tools are designed to support human decision-making and help us identify qualified candidates efficiently and objectively. All final hiring decisions are made by people. If you have any concerns, require accommodations, or would like to opt-out of the use of AI in our hiring process, please let us know at ----- style=\"min-height:1.5em\"> LILT is an equal opportunity employer. We extend equal opportunity to all individuals without regard to an individual’s race, religion, color, national origin, ancestry, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, physical or mental disability, medical condition, genetic characteristics, veteran or marital status, pregnancy, or any other classification protected by applicable local, state or federal laws. We are committed to the principles of fair employment and the elimination of all discriminatory practices. Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow",
